<title>FRANCE: Paribas says no plans to change Italy BCI stake.</title>
<headline>Paribas says no plans to change Italy BCI stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for holding company Paribas said on Friday it currently has no plans to change its three percent stake in Italy's Banca Commerciale Italiana (BCI).</p>
<p>&quot;We have three percent of BCI. There are currently no plans to increase or decrease that stake,&quot; a Paribas spokesman said in response to Italian newspaper reports the French company had raised its stake to five percent.</p>
<p>There has been speculation in Italy that Paribas and insurer Generali were in an alliance to build up a stake in BCI.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsdesk +33 1 4221 5452</p>
